{
  "name": "Ibisian Spellcasting",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You know the Message cantrip. When you reach 3rd level, you can cast the Bless spell once per day; you must finish a Long Rest in order to cast the spell again using this trait. When you reach 5th level, you can also cast the Augury spell once per day; you must finish a Long Rest in order to cast the spell again using this trait. INT, WIS, or CHA is your spellcasting ability for these spells (your choice). You can also cast them using spell slots you have of the appropriate level.</p>",
